# Browser end-to-end for `mokata ide` (ci.yml `ide-e2e`, 0.0.26 O9). Test tooling, not a mokata dep.
# The job installs NO mokata package: the e2e runs this checkout's src/ (PYTHONPATH), so its
# runtime set is pinned here instead — the `mcp` floor/ceiling from pyproject.toml and EVERY `[ide]`
# requirement (keep this list equal to pyproject's `ide` extra; tests/test_o9_ide_e2e_in_ci.py reds
# when they part) — and the whole job installs hash-pinned (no editable-install site).
# The playwright version pins the Chromium build `python -m playwright install chromium` fetches.
